          "expr": "legX = length/2 - 0.12 + px\nnegLegX = 0.12 - length/2 + px\nlegZ = width/2 - 0.12 + py\nnegLegZ = 0.12 - width/2 + py\nbaseY = legHeight\nmattY = legHeight + frameThickness\nmattTopY = legHeight + frameThickness + mattressThickness\nmattL = length - 0.12\nmattW = width - 0.12\nheadX = 0 - length/2 - 0.03 + px\nheadTotalH = legHeight + frameThickness + mattressThickness + headboardHeight\npillX = 0.45 - length/2 + px\npillZ = width/4 + py\nnegPillZ = 0 - width/4 + py\npillW = width/2 - 0.15\ncx = px\ncy = py"
